{"headword":"צִיר²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.13\">Pr 25:13</a></sup> <strong>envoy, messenger</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.14\">Je 49:14</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.17\">Pr 13:17</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִירִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.2\">Is 18:2</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִרַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.9\">57:9</a>;—<em>envoy</em>, from Cush <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 18:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.18.2\">Is 18:2</a>, from apostate Isr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.9\">57:9</a>; from <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.14\">Je 49:14</a> = <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:1\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.1\">Ob 1</a>; <em>messenger</em> in gen. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיר אֱמוּנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.17\">Pr 13:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳ נֶאֱמָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.13\">25:13</a>.—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִיר</span> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, צוּר³\" href=\"/BDB,_צוּר³\", dir=\"rtl\">IV. צור</a>."}]},"rid":"BDB08382","strong_numbers":["6735","6736","6737"],"next_hw":"ציר²","prev_hw":"ציר","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"II.","quotes":[],"GK":["7493","7494","7495","7496","7497"],"TWOT":["1900b","1913a","1914a","1914b"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}